      "text": "Figure 1, 'Elements of a strong catch-up vaccination strategy', on the page that introduces Section 1, 'Principles of catch-up vaccination'. A circle of five coloured segments around a central circle, 'Catch-up vaccination policy and schedule': strategies for catch-up vaccination; vaccines and supplies for catch-up vaccination; health worker knowledge and practice; recording and reporting practices, information systems and tools; and communications and community engagement to build support. The same figure is also placed on the page as a raster image (img-p011-1).",
